Subject: [PATCH] feat(devices): add Oraimo Watch 6 Lite (OSW-809) MoYoung V2
 coordinator

Minimal device mapping onto the maintained MoYoung/CRREPA engine:
name regex (incl. observed _HHHH MAC suffix), name/icon/manufacturer
resources, MTU request 508 (family convention; framing follows negotiated
MTU). No protocol changes, no bind handshake, no DFU, no capability claims
beyond family defaults. Evidence: on-device MOYOUNG-V2 + FEEA GATT capture
2026-10-05, official APK developer=MOY, FCC HW MOY.MA4011.01-Z.
